OL,3,APassengers face airport delays as US
OL,4,Aflights resume after nationwide ground
OL,5,Astop
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Transportation Secretary Sean Duffy
OL,8,Fsays a nationwide ground stop has been
OL,9,Flifted after an outage halted all
OL,10,Fflights
OL,12,FDuffy says the travel chaos is going to
OL,13,Ftake time to unwind, with many
OL,14,Fpassengers still stranded at airports
OL,16,FHomeland Security Secretary Markwayne
OL,17,FMullin says it was caused by a
OL,18,F"telecommunications outage", and that
OL,19,Fthere's zero evidence this was a
OL,20,Fcyber-attack
