OL,3,APassengers face airport delays as US
OL,4,Aflights resume after nationwide ground
OL,5,Astop
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficials have blamed old systems for
OL,8,Fthe outage, saying this could happen
OL,9,Fagain without a "complete overhaul"
OL,11,FThe incident was the largest groundstop
OL,12,Fin the US since the one after 11
OL,13,FSeptember 2001
OL,15,FUS-bound flights from across Europe
OL,16,Fwere suspended after a Federal Aviation
OL,17,FAdministration request
